{
  "rationale": "Use a minimal plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in small deterministic specifications. The policy gives strong preference to forward progress in clear space, uses directed one-shot turns for side obstacles, uses a brief backward pulse only for front-obstacle recovery, and returns to forward exploration immediately when path_clear is observed. Action states self-loop on path_clear so open-loop pulses are not preempted, while safety-critical obstacle events can redirect recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion capability in the plant.",
    "Use one policy specification for clear-space exploration, one for front-obstacle recovery, one for left-obstacle recovery, and one for right-obstacle recovery."
  ],
